{"v":1,"app":"spectraslide","title":"Studio Prism, présentation de l'entreprise","theme":{"id":"studio"},"size":"16:9","slides":[{"id":"s01","v":"title","lay":"free","els":[{"id":"e004","t":"shape","k":"hex","x":560,"y":-120,"w":820,"h":820,"fill":"#0E2E7A","r":0,"op":0.35},{"id":"e001","t":"img","x":690,"y":64,"w":540,"h":339,"src":"m:at_hero_d","fit":"cover","r":12,"shadow":24,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e002","t":"img","x":600,"y":268,"w":470,"h":295,"src":"m:av_hero_d","fit":"cover","r":12,"shadow":24,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e005","t":"img","x":80,"y":150,"w":107,"h":124,"src":"m:studio_prism","fit":"contain","an":{"k":"zoom"}},{"id":"e006","t":"text","x":80,"y":300,"w":470,"h":80,"html":"Studio Prism","st":{"f":"h","fs":66,"fc":"#FFFFFF","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.12,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e007","t":"text","x":82,"y":386,"w":450,"h":90,"html":"Créer des systèmes numériques qui prennent forme.","st":{"f":"b","fs":25,"fc":"#B8C7E0","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.3},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e008","t":"shape","k":"pill","x":82,"y":500,"w":140,"h":4,"fill":"#03A2AC","r":16,"g2":"#F2A541","ga":90,"an":{"k":"wipe"}},{"id":"e009","t":"text","x":82,"y":520,"w":460,"h":60,"html":"Applications, jeu vidéo et 3D<br>Les gammes Archi et SPECTRA","st":{"f":"b","fs":16,"fc":"#7FD8DF","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.5},"an":{"k":"fade"}},{"id":"e010","t":"text","x":82,"y":650,"w":400,"h":24,"html":"Creative &amp; Technical Solutions","st":{"f":"b","fs":13,"fc":"#6F82A8","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"ls":0.06}}],"notes":"Bonjour à tous. Studio Prism est un studio créatif et technologique : nous concevons des applications, des expériences interactives, des solutions BIM et XR et des créations 3D. Dans cette présentation : nos trois pôles, puis nos deux gammes de logiciels, Archi et SPECTRA, avec un focus sur ArchiVision et ArchiTrafic. Toutes les images sont des captures réelles de nos applications.","tr":"fade","nodeco":true,"bg":{"g":["#040B26","#0A2470"],"a":135}},{"id":"s02","v":"content","lay":"free","els":[{"id":"e011","t":"text","x":80,"y":72,"w":520,"h":110,"html":"Un studio créatif et technologique","st":{"f":"h","fs":40,"fc":"#0F1B33","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.12,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e012","t":"text","x":80,"y":196,"w":500,"h":150,"html":"Fondé par <b>Kéliann Mauger</b> et <b>Paul Cocagne</b>, Studio Prism conçoit des applications, des expériences interactives, des solutions BIM/XR et des créations 3D qui relient conception, technologie et réalité.","st":{"f":"b","fs":18,"fc":"#4A5570","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.55},"an":{"k":"fade"}},{"id":"e013","t":"text","x":80,"y":372,"w":160,"h":60,"html":"3","st":{"f":"h","fs":50,"fc":"#0A5E8E","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"b":1},"an":{"k":"pop"}},{"id":"e014","t":"text","x":80,"y":436,"w":150,"h":50,"html":"pôles : App, Game et 3D","st":{"f":"b","fs":14,"fc":"#4A5570","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35},"an":{"k":"fade"}},{"id":"e015","t":"text","x":252,"y":372,"w":160,"h":60,"html":"2","st":{"f":"h","fs":50,"fc":"#0A5E8E","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"b":1},"an":{"k":"pop"}},{"id":"e016","t":"text","x":252,"y":436,"w":150,"h":50,"html":"gammes : Archi et SPECTRA","st":{"f":"b","fs":14,"fc":"#4A5570","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35},"an":{"k":"fade"}},{"id":"e017","t":"text","x":424,"y":372,"w":160,"h":60,"html":"7","st":{"f":"h","fs":50,"fc":"#0A5E8E","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"b":1},"an":{"k":"pop"}},{"id":"e018","t":"text","x":424,"y":436,"w":150,"h":50,"html":"logiciels conçus par le studio","st":{"f":"b","fs":14,"fc":"#4A5570","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35},"an":{"k":"fade"}},{"id":"e019","t":"shape","k":"round","x":80,"y":530,"w":500,"h":92,"fill":"#EEF6F8","r":14,"an":{"k":"fade"}},{"id":"e020","t":"shape","k":"rect","x":80,"y":530,"w":5,"h":92,"fill":"#03A2AC","r":0,"an":{"k":"fade"}},{"id":"e021","t":"text","x":106,"y":548,"w":456,"h":80,"html":"<b>Notre méthode :</b> un échange de cadrage, puis un prototype minimal à valider avant toute production complète.","st":{"f":"b","fs":16,"fc":"#0F1B33","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.5},"an":{"k":"fade"}},{"id":"e022","t":"img","x":650,"y":120,"w":570,"h":358,"src":"m:site_l","fit":"cover","r":12,"shadow":24,"an":{"k":"zoom"}},{"id":"e023","t":"text","x":650,"y":494,"w":570,"h":40,"html":"Le site du studio : présentation, catalogue de produits, comptes et licences.","st":{"f":"b","fs":13,"fc":"#4A5570","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35},"an":{"k":"fade"}}],"notes":"Studio Prism a été fondé par Kéliann Mauger et Paul Cocagne. Notre signature : relier la conception, la technologie et la réalité. Trois pôles, deux gammes, sept logiciels. Et une méthode simple : on cadre le besoin, on livre un prototype minimal qu'on valide ensemble, puis seulement on produit. À droite, notre site, qui gère aussi les comptes et les licences de toutes nos applications.","tr":"slide","nodeco":true,"bg":{"c":"#F5F8FC"}},{"id":"s03","v":"content","lay":"free","els":[{"id":"e024","t":"text","x":80,"y":60,"w":900,"h":60,"html":"Trois pôles, une même exigence","st":{"f":"h","fs":40,"fc":"#0F1B33","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.12,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e025","t":"text","x":80,"y":122,"w":900,"h":40,"html":"Chaque pôle a son savoir-faire ; tous partagent les mêmes outils, la même rigueur et le même compte client.","st":{"f":"b","fs":17,"fc":"#4A5570","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35},"an":{"k":"fade"}},{"id":"e026","t":"shape","k":"round","x":80,"y":190,"w":350,"h":460,"fill":"#FFFFFF","r":18,"stroke":"#DDE5EA","sw":1,"shadow":14,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e027","t":"img","x":110,"y":224,"w":290,"h":102,"src":"m:prism_app","fit":"contain","an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e028","t":"shape","k":"rect","x":110,"y":352,"w":290,"h":1,"fill":"#DDE5EA","r":0,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e029","t":"text","x":110,"y":372,"w":290,"h":34,"html":"Applications et interfaces","st":{"f":"h","fs":20,"fc":"#0F1B33","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e030","t":"text","x":110,"y":414,"w":290,"h":140,"html":"Applications web et mobiles, interfaces, outils numériques et prototypes. C'est le pôle qui porte les gammes Archi et SPECTRA.","st":{"f":"b","fs":15,"fc":"#4A5570","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.5},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e031","t":"text","x":110,"y":588,"w":290,"h":40,"html":"ArchiVision, ArchiTrafic, ArchiPlan, SPECTRA","st":{"f":"b","fs":12.5,"fc":"#0A5E8E","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e032","t":"shape","k":"round","x":460,"y":190,"w":350,"h":460,"fill":"#FFFFFF","r":18,"stroke":"#DDE5EA","sw":1,"shadow":14,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e033","t":"img","x":490,"y":236,"w":290,"h":78,"src":"m:prism_game","fit":"contain","an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e034","t":"shape","k":"rect","x":490,"y":352,"w":290,"h":1,"fill":"#DDE5EA","r":0,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e035","t":"text","x":490,"y":372,"w":290,"h":34,"html":"Jeu vidéo et interactif","st":{"f":"h","fs":20,"fc":"#0F1B33","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e036","t":"text","x":490,"y":414,"w":290,"h":140,"html":"Univers, mécaniques de jeu et prototypes en 3D temps réel : le pôle explore le jeu vidéo et les expériences interactives.","st":{"f":"b","fs":15,"fc":"#4A5570","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.5},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e037","t":"text","x":490,"y":588,"w":290,"h":40,"html":"Concepts en exploration","st":{"f":"b","fs":12.5,"fc":"#0A5E8E","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e038","t":"shape","k":"round","x":840,"y":190,"w":350,"h":460,"fill":"#FFFFFF","r":18,"stroke":"#DDE5EA","sw":1,"shadow":14,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e039","t":"img","x":870,"y":225,"w":290,"h":100,"src":"m:prism_3d","fit":"contain","an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e040","t":"shape","k":"rect","x":870,"y":352,"w":290,"h":1,"fill":"#DDE5EA","r":0,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e041","t":"text","x":870,"y":372,"w":290,"h":34,"html":"Modélisation et prototypage","st":{"f":"h","fs":20,"fc":"#0F1B33","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e042","t":"text","x":870,"y":414,"w":290,"h":140,"html":"Transformer une idée ou un modèle numérique en objet concret, de la modélisation au prototypage et à la fabrication.","st":{"f":"b","fs":15,"fc":"#4A5570","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.5},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e043","t":"text","x":870,"y":588,"w":290,"h":40,"html":"De l'écran à l'objet physique","st":{"f":"b","fs":12.5,"fc":"#0A5E8E","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.35,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}}],"notes":"Nos trois pôles. Prism App, c'est le cœur de cette présentation : applications web et mobiles, et nos deux gammes de logiciels. Prism Game explore le jeu vidéo et les expériences interactives ; ce sont aujourd'hui des concepts en exploration, rien n'est encore publié. Prism 3D transforme un modèle numérique en objet concret : modélisation, prototypage, fabrication.","tr":"push","nodeco":true,"bg":{"c":"#FFFFFF"}},{"id":"s04","v":"content","lay":"free","els":[{"id":"e044","t":"text","x":80,"y":60,"w":1100,"h":60,"html":"Deux gammes de logiciels","st":{"f":"h","fs":40,"fc":"#FFFFFF","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.12,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e045","t":"shape","k":"round","x":80,"y":160,"w":545,"h":490,"fill":"#0E2560","r":22,"stroke":"#1E3A80","sw":1,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e046","t":"shape","k":"round","x":655,"y":160,"w":545,"h":490,"fill":"#0E2560","r":22,"stroke":"#1E3A80","sw":1,"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e047","t":"text","x":116,"y":192,"w":300,"h":50,"html":"Archi","st":{"f":"h","fs":34,"fc":"#FFFFFF","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.12,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e048","t":"text","x":116,"y":244,"w":470,"h":60,"html":"Le bâtiment, la ville et l'industrie en 3D, directement dans le navigateur.","st":{"f":"b","fs":16,"fc":"#B8C7E0","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.45},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e049","t":"text","x":691,"y":192,"w":300,"h":50,"html":"SPECTRA","st":{"f":"h","fs":34,"fc":"#FFFFFF","ha":"l","va":"t","lh":1.12,"b":1},"an":{"k":"rise"}},{"id":"e050","t":"text","x":691,"y":244,"w":470,"h":60,"html":"La suite bureautique du studio : écrire, calculer et présenter, avec le cloud et l'IA.","st"